  "jcr:description": "Rev360 products provide even flow rates and large working channels to provide  ease-of-use in every procedure.\r\nStryker’s SpeedLock™ connections are intuitive and simple to allow quick assembly of all hardware components. Hysteroscope sheaths are constructed with strong, patented Nanoflex® material, offering lasting protection and durability. In addition tissue may be cut and coagulated through a widespread assortment of Rev360 electrodes.\r\n",
